damping-like torque efficiency 𝜉𝜉DL from 0.01 to 0.13±0.03 (Fig. 3f). The enhanced value is

significantly larger than the corresponding efficiency 0.065 for Pt(10 nm)/CoFeB(3 nm) (SI

